## Entry Points
- `main()` → `run_bot()`
- `Cargo.toml` [[bin]] `install` for setup
- Web UI served at `https://localhost:8443` (TLS by default)
- CLI: `agent.run <goal> [--trace]`

## Current State & Gaps (as of Task 160 completion)

**Completed / Mature:**
- WebSocket ↔ Bus round-trip is the most mature path
- Router / Context Engine fully implemented and wired into CPU (`route_llm_request`)
- Unified Agent Runtime (`RuntimeLoop` + `SimplePlanner`) is now the **default execution engine** (Task 160)
- `run_agent()`, `run_unified_agent()`, and `agent_run` bus handler all use real `RuntimeLoop`
- Router config hot-reload + startup loading implemented
- Comprehensive logging/audit bus + structured tracing (`RuntimeTrace`)
- Skill Registry and MemoryManager fully functional and wired into HyEvo/CPU/RuntimeLoop

**In Progress / Partial:**
- Terminal and UNIX socket I/O are under-connected
- Health-aware fallback in router (`HealthStore`) is stubbed (needs async integration)
- Schedule/profile system in router needs unification with `RouterConfig`
- Arbitration layer is rudimentary (LLM-based skill picker only)

**Future / Not Yet Started:**
- Full `ReflectionPlannerAdapter` integration into default runtime path
- Deep telemetry + health feedback loop into router
- Policy engine for arbitration
- Marketplace / dynamic skill loading

